tart=\"620\" data-end=\"656\">\r\n<p data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"656\">Creatieve en educatieve gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"684\">\r\n<p data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"684\">Direct klaar om te spelen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"695\">Prijs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"707\"><strong data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"707\">€ 14,99</strong></p>",
